+        text = (
+            "⚠️ **Dangerous command requires approval**\n"
+            f"```\n{cmd_preview}\n```\n"
+            f"Reason: {description}\n\n"
+            "Reply `/approve` to execute, `/approve session` to approve this pattern for the session, "
